# Forms & Tables

## Forms

Logical grouping, clear labels, keyboard-friendly, inline validation, disable
submit while in-flight. Client validation improves UX; Convex still enforces rules.

## Tables

Search, filter, sort, pagination, empty states as needed. Keep tables visually
lightweight. Reuse shared primitives.

Empty tables explain what to do next.
